WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.166
Hi, I'm MyHero. I keep your whole health record in one app, and explain it in plain words.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:12.319
Right now your history is all over the place. Photos in a chat. Paper in a drawer.

00:00:12.369 --> 00:00:16.664
Three clinic portals. And a memory under pressure in a ten minute visit.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.404
Step one, snap it once.

00:00:19.454 --> 00:00:23.902
Point the camera at any lab report, prescription or discharge note.

00:00:23.952 --> 00:00:29.943
I read every value, show you each one to check, and file it under the right test and date.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:32.896
Step two, understand it.

00:00:32.946 --> 00:00:37.140
Each reading joins its own tracker, with the range marked.

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:41.238
Blood pressure down ten in six weeks. HbA1c near target.

00:00:41.288 --> 00:00:44.092
You see what changed, not just numbers.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.104
Your medicines live here too.

00:00:47.154 --> 00:00:51.795
Dose times, with food or without, and a warning before the supply runs out.

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:54.828
Step three, hand it over.

00:00:54.878 --> 00:00:57.240
At the clinic, open your summary.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:02.138
Profile, medicines, latest readings and recent visits, on one page.

00:01:02.188 --> 00:01:06.378
Share it by link, code or print, and it ends when you say.

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:09.979
After the visit, record what the doctor said.

00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:13.338
Four quick questions, or a voice note that stays on your phone.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:18.040
Carry a parent's record beside your own, with their permission.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:19.651
One app for the whole family.

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.841
Your record is yours. Never sold.

00:01:22.891 --> 00:01:27.728
Shared only when you say so, and you can download or delete everything, any time.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:34.060
Never walk in unsure. Join the early access list at myhero dot my.
